1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Welcome to Instinct, a simple creator studio for planning

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,401
better Instagram content. In this short tour, you will

3
00:00:08,401 --> 00:00:12,601
learn how to open it, set up your profile,

4
00:00:12,601 --> 00:00:16,802
plan reels, draft thoughtful comments, and track your results.

5
00:00:16,802 --> 00:00:20,993
The easiest way to use Instinct is online. Open

6
00:00:20,993 --> 00:00:25,185
preetending2008 dot github dot io slash instinct hyphen creator

7
00:00:25,185 --> 00:00:29,376
hyphen studio. It opens in your browser, and you

8
00:00:29,376 --> 00:00:31,239
can start right away.

9
00:00:31,239 --> 00:00:35,437
To download your own copy, open the public Instinct

10
00:00:35,437 --> 00:00:39,634
repository on GitHub. Choose the green Code button, then

11
00:00:39,634 --> 00:00:43,832
Download ZIP. Save the zip file to your computer.

12
00:00:43,832 --> 00:00:47,918
In your downloads folder, right click the zip and

13
00:00:47,918 --> 00:00:52,004
choose Extract All. Open the extracted folder, then double

14
00:00:52,004 --> 00:00:56,090
click index dot html. It opens in your browser.

15
00:00:56,090 --> 00:01:00,177
Online is simpler, and both versions save data separately

16
00:01:00,177 --> 00:01:01,539
in that browser.

17
00:01:01,539 --> 00:01:06,045
First, open My Creator Profile. Add your niche, who

18
00:01:06,045 --> 00:01:10,551
you make content for, your usual voice, and two

19
00:01:10,551 --> 00:01:15,058
to six content pillars. Save. This context helps make

20
00:01:15,058 --> 00:01:17,561
the reel prompts more relevant.

21
00:01:17,561 --> 00:01:21,839
Next, open Trend Radar. Use Google Trends, Instagram Explore,

22
00:01:21,839 --> 00:01:26,116
or another source to research a topic yourself. Save

23
00:01:26,116 --> 00:01:30,393
the source link, choose a content pillar, and note

24
00:01:30,393 --> 00:01:34,671
what you observed and why your audience may care.

25
00:01:34,671 --> 00:01:37,522
Instinct does not fetch live trends.

26
00:01:37,522 --> 00:01:42,058
Open Reel Studio and choose your saved signal. Review

27
00:01:42,058 --> 00:01:46,594
the suggested hooks, angles, simple structures, and calls to

28
00:01:46,594 --> 00:01:51,130
action. These are template-based starting points, not AI predictions.

29
00:01:51,130 --> 00:01:55,666
Add your own experience, then save ideas you want

30
00:01:55,666 --> 00:01:56,674
to make.

31
00:01:56,674 --> 00:02:01,549
In your planner, move ideas through Idea, Scripting, Ready,

32
00:02:01,549 --> 00:02:06,424
Scheduled, and Published. A date is only a reminder.

33
00:02:06,424 --> 00:02:11,299
For comments, describe one specific detail, choose your intent,

34
00:02:11,299 --> 00:02:16,174
then edit and copy a draft. Nothing is posted

35
00:02:16,174 --> 00:02:16,716
automatically.

36
00:02:16,716 --> 00:02:21,414
After publishing, enter the numbers from Instagram Insights under

37
00:02:21,414 --> 00:02:26,113
Analytics. Instinct calculates likes, comments, saves, and shares divided

38
00:02:26,113 --> 00:02:30,811
by reach. This is a simple calculation on your

39
00:02:30,811 --> 00:02:35,510
own data, not Instagram's algorithm or a promise of

40
00:02:35,510 --> 00:02:36,032
reach.

41
00:02:36,032 --> 00:02:40,322
Your workspace stays in this browser. Download a backup

42
00:02:40,322 --> 00:02:44,611
from your profile before changing devices. To share Instinct,

43
00:02:44,611 --> 00:02:48,901
send the online app link, not your backup file.

44
00:02:48,901 --> 00:02:53,191
Each person gets a separate workspace. Have fun creating,

45
00:02:53,191 --> 00:02:55,574
and keep it your own.
